{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/2/cc27e42aa8ca74f047f8a090afeef7b57eb84829.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\sqrt[3]{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/8/61891fe4ee8185b4fd6dd052bcd60a6b5ef960e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\sqrt[3]{6}-\\sqrt[3]{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />, then which of the following is correct?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/7/6275aac3d197f0f41e6201b63fc0803fe82d9479.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ x=y\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ x&lt;y\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ x=2y\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ x&gt;2y\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"590\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The question is asking us for an approximation of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ratio\" title=\"Ratio\">ratio</a> between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ec1d1bc3b46ecf2f752388e255796ac0e953398.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x : y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"11\" />. Thus, we are allowed to <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Multiply\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Multiply\">multiply</a> both sides by a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Constant\" title=\"Constant\">constant</a>.\n</p><p>By <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_cube&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Difference of cube (page does not exist)\">difference of cubes</a>,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/0419328786f0df4f4788702e695ca9ff07fae312.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\sqrt[3]{4}(\\sqrt[3]{36}+\\sqrt[3]{18}+\\sqrt[3]{9})&amp;:(\\sqrt[3]{6}-\\sqrt[3]{3})(\\sqrt[3]{36}+\\sqrt[3]{18}+\\sqrt[3]{9})\\\\ 2\\sqrt[3]{18}+2\\sqrt[3]{9}+\\sqrt[3]{36}&amp;:3\\end{align*}\" width=\"425\" height=\"48\" />\nWe can approximate the terms on the LHS; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/b/3eb293723f1af999b2820ff9cd289aa04ef44dcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt[3]{18} &gt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/4/a14b9e0a27fb90ea743567b0fbf75de14f398ccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt[3]{9} &gt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c0485765957d6082fd33d1c7d0cf3c6d432b85d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{36} &gt; 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, so the sum on the left side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/b/4fb0d1185f0123820eddfe1be0c8e308528b8b6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&gt; 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/f/e5fb0fa039b1e7e4fb2ff37c7af93b0ab67563fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"52\" height=\"15\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfbf4df7c25681bb178ddc50ee0c0d656aa25b5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p><i>Remark</i>: There doesn't seem to be any direct way to calculate a simple ratio between the two terms, but various variations can involve approximating terms by multiplying by certain quantities. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\